    <string name="rate_us_message">Hi, you won\'t see this message again.
        \n\nIf you\'re finding Dizzify useful, could you please leave a 5-star review? It\'ll mean the world to us. Thank you!</string>
    <string name="share_message">We need your help! We crossed a million downloads last year. This year, we want to reach a million more, but we can\'t do it alone.
         \n\nClauncher needs people, and people need Dizzify. Could you please share Dizzify with others?</string>
